- aaabbbcccc: a(3),b(3),c(4) -> "a3b3c4" (dl.6), 6/10 = 0.60
- aabbccddee: a(2),b(2),c(2),d(2),e(2) -> "a2b2c2d2e2" (dl.10), 10/10 = 1.00
- abcde: a(1),b(1),c(1),d(1),e(1) -> "a1b1c1d1e1" (dl.10), 10/5 = 2.00
